        </button>
        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">The sheltered inner bay can be suitable for confident beginners under calm conditions. However, the main attraction—the deep channel where Mola Mola are spotted—is strictly for advanced divers due to potential strong currents, down-currents, and significant depth. Always be honest about your experience level with your dive operator.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 bg-white/5">
        <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden')">
          <span class="font-semibold">What’s the ideal season to see Mola Mola at Crystal Bay?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-sm"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">The peak season for Mola Mola sightings is from July to October. During these months, colder water from the deep attracts the sunfish to the reef's 'cleaning stations'. While diving is possible year-round, this is the most reliable window for that bucket-list encounter.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 bg-white/5">
        <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden')">
          <span class="font-semibold">How much does a Crystal Bay dive trip cost?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-sm"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">Diving at Crystal Bay is typically part of a 2 or 3-dive day trip to Nusa Penida from mainland Bali (e.g., Sanur). Expect to pay between $120 to $180 USD per person, which usually includes hotel transfers, boat transport, tanks, weights, a guide, and lunch. Equipment rental is often an additional charge.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 bg-white/5">
        <button class="w-full flex items-center justify-between text-left" onclick="this.nextElementSibling.classList.toggle('hidden')">
          <span class="font-semibold">What special gear should I bring for Crystal Bay?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-sm"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">A 5mm full wetsuit is highly recommended due to the cold thermoclines (water can drop below 20°C/68°F). A Surface Marker Buoy (SMB or DSMB) is essential for safety in case of separation. A reliable dive computer is mandatory to manage your depth, time, and ascent profile safely.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-white/10 rounded-xl p-4 bg-white/5">
