        <div class="hidden mt-3 text-white/80">Absolutely. Crystal Bay is an excellent location for the Deep Dive and Drift Dive adventure dives as part of your PADI Advanced Open Water course. It provides a real-world, challenging-yet-rewarding environment to build new skills under the close supervision of an instructor.</div>
